    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "Cubs have agreed to a multi-year deal with LHP Trevor Rogers, sources confirm to the Tribune. Rogers, who turned 29 earlier this week, had rejected a qualifying offer from the Orioles.",
      "likes": 27,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-24T04:15:32.467Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2zrv3xkds2u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "カブスが左腕トレバー・ロジャースと複数年契約で合意したと、複数の関係者がトリビューン紙に認めた。29歳になったばかりのロジャースは、オリオールズからのクオリファイングオファーを拒否していた。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "The Astros are hiring Aaron Bates as their hitting coach, sources tell @theathletic.com. Bates spent the past 12 seasons as the Los Angeles Dodgers' hitting coach, but parted ways with the team after the season when the two sides could not come to a contract agreement.",
      "likes": 17,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-24T00:05:57.162Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:hqnn3kfpfuhkhv2b4izkrzpa/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2zdwsfj2kv3",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "アストロズがアーロン・ベイツを打撃コーチに迎える、と関係者が@theathletic.comに語った。ベイツはドジャースで過去12シーズン打撃コーチを務めたが、契約で折り合わず、シーズン終了後に袂を分かった。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "Josh Miller had a year remaining on his contract, sources say. Brent Strom's status for next season is uncertain, sources said, but Strom already said in August that he had no desire to be a head pitching coach again. More on Miller's dismissal -www.nytimes.com/athletic/780...",
      "likes": 14,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-23T19:14:25.899Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:hqnn3kfpfuhkhv2b4izkrzpa/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2ytnjgjjsv3",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ジョシュ・ミラーの契約は残り1年だったと関係者は語る。ブレント・ストロームの来季の去就は不透明だが、本人は8月の時点で、再びチーフ投手コーチを務める意思はないと話していた。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "I do love how this will simultaneously be used as an argument for and against a salary cap",
      "likes": 15,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-23T16:28:02.509Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2ykdyjq622u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "これが年俸総額の上限(サラリーキャップ)導入の賛成論にも反対論にも同時に使われるのは、実に面白い"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "Left-hander Trevor Rogers is in agreement on a deal with the Cubs, source confirms, as @jonmorosi reported first. Rogers was a big part of the Orioles’ rotation in 2025 and 2026. He posted a 1.81 ERA in ‘25 and followed it with a 4.03 in ‘26 (2.90 ERA over his last 20 games)",
      "likes": 14,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-24T04:02:13.111Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2zr5bn6a225",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Elias is a terrorist",
          "likes": 9,
          "author": "clearlyashley.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "😞",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "irarigaud.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "左腕トレバー・ロジャースがカブスと合意に至ったと関係者が認めた。@jonmorosiが最初に報じていた。ロジャースは2025年と2026年のオリオールズ先発陣の主力で、'25年は防御率1.81、'26年は4.03(直近20試合は2.90)だった。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "A look at where the #BlueJays' rotation depth stands right now, before any additions, and the lessons from 2026: www.mlb.com/bluejays/new...",
      "likes": 11,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-23T17:34:16.977Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2yo2gusmk27",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Also, I wonder if Bowden Francis could find himself playing a role.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "majael.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Serious question: what are the limits of the statement \"you can never have enough pitching\"? Because, on the one hand, the Jays had an entire rotation on the IL multiple times last year. On the other hand, you can't acquire fifty major league starting pitchers just in case. What is sensible?",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "majael.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "#BlueJays の先発陣の層の厚さが現時点でどうなっているか、補強前の状況と2026年の教訓を整理した。"
    },
    {
